1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,583
What you want is heat removed from the food, and what you pay for is the work.

2
00:00:04,583 --> 00:00:11,002
So the performance figure is beta, Q two over W, called the coefficient of performance.

3
00:00:11,002 --> 00:00:15,182
It is not an efficiency, because it is usually bigger than one.

4
00:00:15,182 --> 00:00:20,507
A good fridge moves four or five joules of heat for every joule of electricity.

